1
00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:05.910
Kanemayu akuwonetsa momwe mungachitire

2
00:00:05.910 --> 00:00:11.580
kuyesa kutsogolo kwa diso pogwiritsa ntchito chapatsogolo

3
00:00:11.580 --> 00:00:14.957
kuzungulira kwachiwiri kwa chipangizo cha Arclight.

4
00:00:14.957 --> 00:00:18.897
Yambani ndi ukhondo m'manja ndikudzidziwitsani nokha.

5
00:00:18.897 --> 00:00:19.460
Tsimikizani

6
00:00:19.460 --> 00:00:25.305
dziwani wodwalayo, fotokozani za kuyezetsa kwake ndikupeza chilolezo choti muchite.

7
00:00:25.305 --> 00:00:26.140
Poyamba kutenga

8
00:00:26.140 --> 00:00:29.841
masekondi angapo kuti muwone maso onse nthawi imodzi.

9
00:00:29.841 --> 00:00:31.860
Yang'anani pa periorbitor, zikope ndi

10
00:00:31.860 --> 00:00:37.540
maso, ndemanga pa kutupa kulikonse, zofiira ndi kumaliseche, komanso kutchuka kwa maso

11
00:00:37.540 --> 00:00:39.694
kapena malo osadziwika bwino a chikope.

12
00:00:39.694 --> 00:00:44.540
Kenako chitani mayeso okulirapo pogwiritsa ntchito kuwala kwa arc.

13
00:00:44.540 --> 00:00:47.966
Yatsani kuwala koyera ndikugwirizira chipangizocho pafupi ndi diso lanu.

14
00:00:47.966 --> 00:00:49.020
Pang'onopang'ono kuyandikira kwa wodwalayo

15
00:00:49.020 --> 00:00:51.277
diso lakumanja choyamba mpaka liyang'ane.

16
00:00:51.277 --> 00:00:53.252
Izi zitha kukhala pafupifupi 6 cm.

17
00:00:53.252 --> 00:00:54.380
Funsani wodwalayo kuti

18
00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:58.940
kusuntha diso lawo kunja ndi mkati, kenako mmwamba ndi pansi, kwinaku akugwira zikope zawo mofatsa;

19
00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:03.442
mwadongosolo kuzindikira mawonekedwe osiyana kapangidwe, kuganiza za iwo m'magulu.

20
00:01:03.442 --> 00:01:04.260
Choyamba

21
00:01:04.260 --> 00:01:11.360
Gululi limaphatikizapo ma eyelashes apamwamba ndi apansi ndi m'mphepete mwa chivindikiro, chachiwiri chimaphatikizapo conjunctiva.

22
00:01:11.360 --> 00:01:16.220
ndi sclera, ndi m'mphuno m'munsi.

23
00:01:16.220 --> 00:01:20.552
Gulu lachitatu ndi cornea, mphambano ya izi ndi sclera yotchedwa sclera

24
00:01:20.552 --> 00:01:21.480
limbi, ndi

25
00:01:21.480 --> 00:01:24.380
Mwana wa diso, atazunguliridwa ndi iris.

26
00:01:24.380 --> 00:01:29.940
Mukamaliza kulemba zonse izi, pitilizani kuyesa kuya kwa chipinda cham'mbuyo.

27
00:01:29.940 --> 00:01:34.100
Chipinda cham'mbuyo ndi danga pakati pa cornea ndi iris.

28
00:01:34.100 --> 00:01:38.514
Mwakuwalitsa kuwala kuchokera kumbali yanthawi, kuya kwa chipinda cham'mbuyo

29
00:01:38.514 --> 00:01:39.460
akhoza kuyesedwa.

30
00:01:39.460 --> 00:01:44.220
Mthunzi wa m'mphuno wa iris ukhoza kusonyeza chipinda chosazama chakunja.

31
00:01:44.220 --> 00:01:48.380
Uku ndikuwunika kwabwinobwino popanda mthunzi.

32
00:01:48.380 --> 00:01:51.020
Tsopano sankhani kuwala kwa buluu pa kuwala kwa arc.

33
00:01:51.020 --> 00:01:56.140
Ndi utoto wa fluorescing filimu yamisozi, madera otayika a epithelial ndi matenda adzawonetsedwa.

34
00:01:56.140 --> 00:01:59.140
Utoto umawala kwambiri ndi kuwala kwa buluu.

35
00:01:59.140 --> 00:02:04.200
chithunzi cha malo ndi kukula kwa madera a epithelial imfa ndi matenda.

36
00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.300
Mukamaliza kuyang'ana mbale yapamwamba ya tarsal, ikani thonje la thonje pachivundikiro chapamwamba,

37
00:02:09.300 --> 00:02:14.400
ndiye mofatsa kwezani zingwe mmwamba kwinaku mukukankhira pansi pang'onopang'ono ndi mphukira.

38
00:02:14.400 --> 00:02:19.920
Poyamba amawonedwa ndi maso, ndiye bweretsani kuwala kwa arc kuti muwone bwino.

39
00:02:19.920 --> 00:02:22.180
Bwerezaninso kafukufukuyu pa diso lina.

40
00:02:22.180 --> 00:02:27.360
Pambuyo pake, thokozani wodwalayo, kufotokoza mwachidule zolemba zomwe mwapeza ndikubwereza ukhondo wamanja.

41
00:02:27.360 --> 00:02:31.360
Chonde onani makanema athu ena a projekiti ya University of St Andrews Arc Light.
